# Cardinality certificates for the fixed Baby Monster matrix image

`Reduction` proves the transfer from the two standard matrices to the eleven
Table 1 words under an explicit simultaneous conjugacy, and assembles the
required coprime divisors. The concrete conjugacy and divisibility certificates
are still to be constructed; no unconditional image-size assertion is made here.

Source: Breuer–Magaard–Wilson (2019), §3.4,
https://arxiv.org/abs/1902.07758.
